This product includes software adapted from threads-toolkit
(https://github.com/Chuanyin1202/threads-toolkit), licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Specifically, the DOM-parsing heuristic used to locate a post's container
element (walk up from the post permalink until a container with two or
more like/comment/repost buttons is found) and the field-extraction logic
(author, content, stats, images, videos) in threads_dl/extractor.py are
translated line-for-line from that project's TypeScript source
(src/utils/parser.ts) into a standalone JavaScript snippet invoked from
Python via Playwright. The network-response interception technique used
to capture video URLs is likewise adapted from that project's
src/actions/post.ts.

Everything else in this repository — the Python package structure, browser
lifecycle management, error classification, CLI, and download logic — is
original work independent of threads-toolkit.
